description: Repo-wide conventions for the scheduling service
alwaysApply: true
---

This rule is always attached, so keep it to what every edit needs.

- Maximum line length: 80 characters.
- Named exports only. No default exports.
- Tests come after the implementation is reviewed — write the code, get the
  shape agreed, then cover it.

## Commits

Conventional commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`). Subject line under 72
characters, imperative mood, no trailing period.
